Cliveden House.

966
00:54:00.970 --> 00:54:01.570
Taplow.

967
00:54:01.910 --> 00:54:04.350
Yeah, built for Queen Victoria by the Sutherlands.

968
00:54:04.610 --> 00:54:08.350
And it's located on the River Thames in the grounds of Cliveden House.

969
00:54:09.270 --> 00:54:13.190
It's a three-bedroom Riverside property with a private garden and covered porch.

970
00:54:13.450 --> 00:54:14.730
Well, that sounds lovely.

971
00:54:15.190 --> 00:54:15.310
I mean, done.

972
00:54:15.710 --> 00:54:15.970
Okay.

